Run
.B distroforge branding\-palettes
for the palette list.
.TP
.B Secure Boot (4)
.BR \-\-secure\-boot ,
.BR \-\-secure\-boot\-mok\-key ,
.BR \-\-secure\-boot\-mok\-cert ,
.BR \-\-secure\-boot\-sign\-modules .
.TP
.B Custom kernel (19)
