options select the source, verification and packaging of an out\-of\-tree module
or a rebuilt kernel, plus
.B \-\-no\-kernel\-pgp
and
.BR \-\-prune\-obsolete\-kernels .
.B \-\-kernel\-channel
takes
.BR stable " (default), "
.B longterm
or
