Installed documentation lives in
.IR /usr/share/doc/distroforge/ .
Start with
.IR README.md ,
then
.I docs/build\-pipeline.md
for the pipeline,
.I docs/definitions.md
for the definition schema,
.I docs/gui\-parity.md
for the CLI/GUI mapping and
.I docs/debian\-canonical\-compliance.md
for the packaging rules.
.SH BUGS
DistroForge 0.3.5 is alpha software. Build on a dedicated host or virtual
machine, review the plan before executing, and keep backups before privileged
operations.
